<section class="page-hero">
  <div id="ambient-canvas" class="ambient-canvas"></div>
  <div class="container page-hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Free Tool</span>
    <h1>Free Dofollow Link Checker — Find Nofollow, Sponsored and UGC Links in Any HTML</h1>
    <p>Paste a page's HTML and this <strong>free dofollow link checker</strong> lists every link with its rel attribute: followed, nofollow, sponsored or ugc, internal or external. It also catches a page-level robots nofollow that changes every link. No signup, nothing leaves your browser.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container contact-grid llms-tool-grid">
    <div>
      <form class="contact-form llms-form" id="dl-form" onsubmit="return false;" aria-label="Dofollow link checker form">
        <div>
          <label for="dl-html">Page HTML (view source, copy, paste)</label>
          <textarea id="dl-html" style="min-height: 260px;" placeholder="&lt;a href=&quot;https://example.com/guide&quot;&gt;A guide&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partner.com&quot; rel=&quot;sponsored&quot;&gt;Partner&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href=&quot;https://forum.com/x&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Comment link&lt;/a&gt;"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="dl-domain">Your domain (optional, to separate internal from external)</label>
          <input type="text" id="dl-domain" placeholder="example.com" autocomplete="off">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label><input type="checkbox" id="dl-only"> Show only external links</label>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-info-card llms-preview-card">
      <div class="llms-preview-head">
        <strong>Link report</strong>
        <span id="dl-status" class="llms-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Waiting for input</span>
      </div>
      <pre id="dl-output" class="llms-output" style="max-height:480px;white-space:pre-wrap;">Paste HTML to list its links.</pre>
      <div class="llms-actions" style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="dl-copy">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container llms-explainer">

    <h2>What the Checker Reports</h2>
    <ul class="service-points">
      <li><strong>Followed.</strong> A link with no rel value of nofollow, sponsored or ugc. People call these dofollow links, but "dofollow" is not an HTML value. A link is simply followed unless you mark it otherwise.</li>
      <li><strong>Nofollow, sponsored and ugc.</strong> The three rel values Google documents. Sponsored marks paid placements, ugc marks user-generated content, and nofollow is the general hint.</li>
      <li><strong>Internal or external.</strong> Enter your domain and each link is labelled by whether it stays on your site.</li>
      <li><strong>Page-level nofollow.</strong> A robots meta tag containing nofollow applies to every link on the page, even those without a rel value. The checker flags it.</li>
      <li><strong>Skipped links.</strong> Anchors that are not web links, such as mailto, tel, javascript and in-page fragments, are counted separately.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to Use the Report</h2>
    <p>Run it on a page that links out to a partner, a sponsor or a forum, and check that each link carries the value you intended. Run it on a page where you earned a link to confirm that the link pointing to you is followed. The tool reads the HTML you paste, which is the same source a crawler receives for a static page. If your page builds links with JavaScript, copy the rendered HTML from the browser's element inspector instead of the page source.</p>
    <p>A few things sit outside the HTML and cannot be seen here. An X-Robots-Tag HTTP header can set nofollow for a whole file, and a link inside a blocked or noindexed page may not pass what you expect. Treat the report as a check of the markup, and use a crawler or Search Console to confirm the rest.</p>

    <h2>Dofollow Link Checker FAQs</h2>
    <div class="faq-list" style="margin-top: 22px;">
      <details>
        <summary>Is "dofollow" an official HTML attribute?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p>No. There is no dofollow value. A link is followed by default and becomes nofollow, sponsored or ugc only when the rel attribute says so.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can this tool check the backlinks pointing to my site?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p>It checks the HTML you paste. To check a backlink, open the page that links to you, copy its HTML, paste it here and enter your domain. The report shows how that link is marked.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Why is a link without rel still marked nofollow?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p>The page has a robots meta tag containing nofollow, which applies to all links on the page. The checker shows this as a page-level setting.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What is the difference between sponsored, ugc and nofollow?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p>Sponsored is for paid or compensated links, ugc is for user-generated content such as comments and forum posts, and nofollow is the general hint when neither applies. Google treats all three as hints.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does this tool store or send my data anywhere?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p>No. The HTML is parsed in your browser with JavaScript. Nothing is uploaded, logged or stored on any server, including ours.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-band" style="margin-top: 44px;">
      <span class="cta-orb cta-orb-1"></span>
      <span class="cta-orb cta-orb-2"></span>
      <h2>Want your backlink profile reviewed?</h2>
      <p>Contomatix checks link quality, attributes and anchors as part of a link audit.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/<%= site.whatsappNumber %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-glass">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

